// Kept by hand (the importer no longer writes this file). One row per item of the original
// (`ITEMDATA.LBX`, 250), in its order. `effects` are the plain bonuses: to hit in pluses,
// movement in half-moves (`HalfMoves`: `ITEMDATA.LBX` stores whole moves and `Add_Item` doubles them, so
// the values here are twice the file's). `powers` name rows of `item_powers.ron`. `flag` is the original's byte as stored (the five book bytes are not kept: they were a scrambled per-power need, see `docs/heroes-items-design.md` 2.1). The two names the original uses twice carry I and II.
// `num` is the original's item number (its row in ITEMDATA.LBX); `id` is the alias for human editing.
